  "immersive_nature.fluids.text.and_for_the_default_override_it": "。默认覆盖值为：",
  "immersive_nature.fluids.text.the_sea_level_override_for_this": "该维度的海平面现已设为",
  "immersive_nature.fluids.text.warning_mod_or_datapack_changes_that": "。警告！修改维度属性的模组或数据包会取消此设置……",
